  "semantics": "Left enrich input 0 with 1..14 independent lookups; every key is an observed compatible field. NULL matches NULL, duplicate matches multiply, unmatched main rows survive, lookup keys are excluded. Complete keys and literal prefixes required for input changes. Exact output order needs autosync=false. Native UI has no join selector, computed keys or key conversion. Full coverage is a separate owner decision; this card does not admit it.",
